<Positioned left="90" top="866"><Text fontSize="13" color="#93A9BD" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">碎屑沿沉降一路增大，可到几厘米 [S08] —— 视觉为演示比例</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="930"><Text fontSize="15" color="#E8F0F5" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">足够多的碎屑成为深海居民的主粮 [S08]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="980" width="430" height="160"><Container width="430" height="160" color="#0E2438" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #1E3A52" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1000"><Text fontSize="18" color="#9FD8CC" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">几周才到底</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1034" width="386"><Text fontSize="15" color="#E8F0F5" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">一些碎屑要下落数周才能触底；上层的消耗会一路削减它</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1108"><Text fontSize="14" color="#C9A15A" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S08]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="510" top="980" width="430" height="160"><Container width="430" height="160" color="#0E2438" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #1E3A52" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="532" top="1000"><Text fontSize="18" color="#9FD8CC" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">鲸也来过</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="532" top="1034" width="386"><Text fontSize="15" color="#E8F0F5" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">抹香鲸能下潜到这一带觅食（1,000–4,000 m）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="532" top="1108"><Text fontSize="14" color="#C9A15A" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S22]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1160" width="880" height="120"><Container width="880" height="120" color="#0E2438" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #1E3A52" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1180"><Text fontSize="18" color="#9FD8CC" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">唯一的光源</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1214" width="836"><Text fontSize="15" color="#E8F0F5" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">这里唯一的亮，来自生物自身的发光 —— 光体为唯一照明</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1248"><Text fontSize="14" color="#C9A15A" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S22]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="0" top="1342" width="1000" height="58"><Container width="1000" height="58" color="#0A1F33" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="24" top="1360" width="640"><Text fontSize="15" color="#93A9BD" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">下一站 4,000 m：『无底』的黑暗底土</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="680" top="1360"><Text fontSize="15" color="#C9A15A" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S07 / S08 / S22]</Text></Positioned>
